6.0.2.0

- Apex Legends stays detected through startup and window-title changes.
- League of Legends match close no longer waits for its launcher to exit.
- Lucid respects Equalizer APO custom config directories.
- First-run EQ waits for a headset answer, including F11.
- The F11 toast follows a confirmed EQ change while the master cue stays synced with the star.
- Lucid Voice clears buffered mic audio when turned off.
- Legacy ProgramData settings migrate separately for each Windows account.
